    {
      "text": "Choropleth map of a fictitious country’s districts shaded by coverage category: 0–70% (red), 70–80% (orange), 80–90% (light green), 90–100% (dark green) and uncertain (blue). Most of the country, including the large northern district, is in the 90–100% band; one central district is 0–70%, one southern district is 70–80%, and a small southern district is marked uncertain.",
